# ==============================================================================
# EmailJS Configuration for Direct In-Page Email Delivery
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Sign up for a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service:
#    - Go to "Email Services" > "Add New Service"
#    - Select Gmail (or your preferred email provider)
#    - Connect sdivakar052@gmail.com
#    - Copy your Service ID (e.g. service_xxxxxxx)
#
# 3. Create an Email Template:
#    - Go to "Email Templates" > "Create New Template"
#    - Set Subject to: {{subject}} (from {{name}})
#    - In the content body, include:
#        Name: {{name}}
#        Email: {{email}}
#        Subject: {{subject}}
#        Message: {{message}}
#    - Set "To Email" to: sdivakar052@gmail.com
#    - Set "Reply-To" to: {{email}}
#    - Save and copy your Template ID (e.g. template_xxxxxxx)
#
# 4. Get your Public Key:
#    - Go to "Account" > "Security & Keys"
#    - Copy your "Public Key" (e.g. user_xxxxxxx / xxxxxxxxxx)
#
# 5. Setup:
#    - Local: Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
#    - Vercel: Go to Project Settings > Environment Variables, and add all 3 variables
# ==============================================================================

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key
